---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="LearningML"
  description="Learn AI by building real projects"
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/"
>
  <main class="hero">
    <header class="hero__header">
      <div class="hero__mark">LearningML</div>
      <nav class="hero__nav">
        <a href="/en/what-is-machine-learning/">What is</a>
        <a href="/en/why-learn-machine-learning/">Why</a>
        <a href="/en/blog/">Blog</a>
        <a href="/en/studies-about-learningml/">Studies</a>
        <a href="https://learningml.org/manual/">Manual</a>
        <details class="hero__dropdown">
          <summary>
            About
            <span class="hero__caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="hero__submenu">
            <a href="/en/about-learningml-and-its-author/">About</a>
            <a href="/en/acknowledgment/">Acknowledgments</a>
          </div>
        </details>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero__content">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">Creative Artificial Intelligence</p>
      <div class="hero__headline">
        <h1>Learn Machine Learning Fundamentals</h1>
        <a
          class="hero__ribbon"
          href="https://all-digital.org/all-digital-awards-2024-best-digital-resource/"
        >
          <span class="hero__ribbon-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏆</span>
          All Digital Awards 2024 Winner
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero__lead">
        LearningML combines a visual editor with Scratch so anyone can train models
        and create interactive experiences.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="button primary" href="/lml-editor/">Open editor</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="/scratch/">Go to Scratch</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="/en/learningml-desktop/">LearningML Desktop</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="hero__grid">
      <article>
        <h3>Collect Data</h3>
        <p>Collect texts or images about something you want to classify automatically and add them to LearningML, indicating which class each one belongs to. These data make up the training set.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Create a model</h3>
        <p>Build with LearningML a model capable of correctly classifying other data that are different, yet similar, to those in the training set.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Build an application</h3>
        <p>Export your Machine Learning model to Scratch and program an application capable of classifying data about the topic you chose. Congratulations! You have added Artificial Intelligence to your Scratch program!</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 3rem clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 5rem);
      display: grid;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .hero__header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .hero__mark {
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .hero__nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hero__dropdown {
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero__dropdown summary {
      list-style: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
    .hero__dropdown summary::-webkit-details-marker {
      display: none;
    }
    .hero__caret {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .hero__dropdown[open] .hero__caret {
      transform: rotate(180deg);
    }
    .hero__submenu {
      position: absolute;
      top: 100%;
      right: 0;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      min-width: 180px;
      z-index: 5;
    }
    .hero__dropdown:not([open]) .hero__submenu {
      display: none;
    }
    .hero__submenu a {
      text-transform: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .hero__content h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 4.2rem);
      margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    }
    .hero__headline {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: center;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    }
    .hero__ribbon {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(30, 27, 22, 0.1);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .hero__ribbon-icon {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .hero__eyebrow {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .hero__lead {
      max-width: 60ch;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero__headline {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        justify-items: start;
      }
      .hero__ribbon {
        white-space: normal;
      }
    }

    .hero__cta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .button {
      padding: 0.75rem 1.6rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .button.primary {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .button.ghost {
      background: transparent;
    }

    .hero__grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    }

    .hero__grid article {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }
  </style>
</Base>
